{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"启示录","commonName":"启示录","title":"启示录","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"d51813eeb92e52c116e540460191a340affdfe0ba2e16b4df2e89cff219ae65e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":405},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["天使和小书卷"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我又看见另有一位大力的天使从天降下，披着云彩，头上有虹，脸面像日头，两脚像火柱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他手里拿着小书卷，是展开的。他右脚踏海，左脚踏地，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["大声呼喊，好像狮子吼叫。呼喊完了，就有七雷发声。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["七雷发声之后，我正要写出来，就听见从天上有声音说：「七雷所说的，你要封上，不可写出来。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我所看见的那踏海踏地的天使向天举起右手来，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["指着那创造天和天上之物，地和地上之物，海和海中之物，直活到永永远远的，起誓说：「不再有时日了",{"noteId":6},"。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["但在第七位天使吹号发声的时候， 神的奥秘就成全了，正如 神所传给他仆人众先知的佳音。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我先前从天上所听见的那声音又吩咐我说：「你去，把那踏海踏地之天使手中展开的小书卷取过来。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我就走到天使那里，对他说：「请你把小书卷给我。」他对我说：「你拿着吃尽了，便叫你肚子发苦，然而在你口中要甜如蜜。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我从天使手中把小书卷接过来，吃尽了，在我口中果然甜如蜜，吃了以后，肚子觉得发苦了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["天使",{"noteId":7},"对我说：「你必指着多民、多国、多方、多王再说预言。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":6,"caller":"-","text":"或译：不再耽延了","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":6}},{"noteId":7,"caller":"-","text":"原文是他们","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}